    "blocks": [
      {
        "key": "content",
        "text": "I\u2019m a strategist who is curious about why people connect with certain brands, ideas, and experiences. I recently graduated from SCAD with an M.A. in Luxury & Brand Management and now work with Dimohe in New York, where I\u2019m gaining hands-on experience across e-commerce, marketing, and strategy.",
