    "autosize": true,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "key": "content",
        "text": "My path has never been particularly linear. I\u2019ve worked in fintech at Payoneer in Israel, explored merchandising and luxury at Versace, and spent a year at SCAD FASH Museum of Fashion + Film. I joined the museum as a docent and was promoted to Lead Docent, eventually leading a team of 20+ while working across exhibitions, events, retail, and visitor experience. Each role has given me a different way of understanding people and the decisions they make.",
