        "key": "content",
        "text": "That curiosity is also shaped by where I\u2019ve lived. I was born in India and grew up across Sri Lanka, Qatar, Israel, and the United States. Moving between cultures taught me to observe first and assume less. It\u2019s a perspective I carry into the way I think about consumers, culture, and the stories that resonate with them.",
